{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' solver_index.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Generated solver source index\n\nUse line ranges to inspect only definitions relevant to the current level.\n\n## players.py\n- L7--10 `def play_level_1(env):`; calls: align_selected_cross, select_next_cross\n- L13--18 `def play_level_2(env):`; calls: align_selected_cross, align_selected_outline, select_next_cross\n- L21--22 `def play_level_3(env):`; calls: align_outline_group\n- L25--30 `def play_level_4(env):`; calls: align_selected_outline, recolor_selected_outline, select_next_cross\n- L33--44 `def play_level_5(env):`; calls: align_outline_group, align_selected_outline, recolor_selected_outline, select_next_cross\n- L47--55 `def play_level_6(env):`; calls: align_selected_outline, deform_selected_outline, select_next_cross\n\n## legs.py\n- L6--38 `def align_selected_cross(env, stride=3):` — Translate the selected cross onto its matching ring targets.; calls: Counter, ValueError, abs, int, len, map\n- L41--43 `def select_next_cross(env):` — Cycle selection without translating either cross.\n- L46--85 `def deform_selected_outline(env, approach, push_action, pushes, departure=()):` — Push an outline against a solid obstacle, then leave by safe waypoints.; calls: Counter, ValueError, body, int, map, range, sleep, tuple, walk\n- L88--135 `def recolor_selected_outline(env, color, stride=3, return_to_start=False, retreat_column=None):` — Visit a bordered palette swatch, then retreat vertically into the board.; calls: ValueError, abs, map, min, range, round, sleep\n- L138--191 `def align_selected_outline(env, stride=3):` — Fit a translated visible outline over every matching ring center.; calls: Counter, ValueError, abs, all, int, map, min, set, sorted, targets\n- L194--302 `def align_outline_group(env, count, stride=3, selection_stride=1, require_reward=True, horizontal_first=False):` — Jointly translate same-color